<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-TOP SEEDS RIOS AND ENQVIST IN STRAIGHT SETS VICTORIES.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TOP SEEDS RIOS AND ENQVIST IN STRAIGHT SETS VICTORIES.</headline>
<dateline>MARSEILLE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top seeds Marcelo Rios and Thomas Enqvist scored straight sets victories in the second round of the Marseille Open tennis tournament on Thursday.</p>
<p>Chilean Rios, the number one seed, beat little-known Johan van Herck of Belgium 6-2 6-4.</p>
<p>Swede Enqvist, seeded second, was expecting a tough test from rising Dominik Hrbaty of Slovakia, who jumped 287 places up to 77th in the ATP Tour rankings last year. But Hrbaty could do very little on his way to a 6-3 6-2 defeat.</p>
</text>
